      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, im working on this philosophy paper about how individual liberty and collective responsibility clash when it comes to modern tax policy. can u give me a detailed breakdown of the moral frameworks that libertarians use vs the ones social democrats use? i really need to make sure i'm presenting the most compelling, high-level arguments for both sides so my essay is actually rigorous. thanks!",
